Welcome to this week's Top 7, where the DEV editorial team handpicks their favorite posts from the previous week. Congrats to all the authors that made it onto the list 👏 “Why Do You Code?” - A Surprisingly Hard Question Sylwia Laskowska ・ Dec 30 '25 #programming #discuss
@sylwia-lask reflects on the deeper motivations behind being a developer, moving past standard answers like money or passion to explore the joy of problem-solving. The author encourages readers to find their own "why" to maintain long-term fulfillment in their careers. First steps towards Codeberg Thomas Künneth ・ Dec 31 '25 #opensource #privacy #digitalsovereignty #git
@tkuenneth shares their journey of migrating repositories to Codeberg, highlighting the benefits of support…
